WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Quick replies”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Quick replies
Choose Quick replies from the menu and start adding a reply.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Write the reply
Set a clear title, the reply text and the right team if the option is available.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Save and use
Save the reply, then open a conversation and try picking it from the quick replies before sending.
